      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "Uses discriminated string-literal unions to mirror Rust's SessionStatus enum, with doc comments explicitly calling out the Rust source-of-truth files (agent_core/core/session/types/enums.rs) that must be kept in sync."
